bのローカルナレッジベース管理と検索ツール","ko":"github-kb는 GitHub 지식库 관리와 검색 도구입니다","es":"github-kb es una herramienta de gestión de conocimiento que utiliza la CLI de gh para buscar y catalogar proyectos en GitHub","fr":"github-kb est un outil de gestion des connaissances qui utilise la CLI de gh pour rechercher et cataloguer des projets sur GitHub","de":"github-kb ist ein Wissensmanagement-Tool, das die gh-CLI verwendet, um Projekte in GitHub zu suchen und zu katalogisieren","pt":"O github-kb é uma ferramenta de gerenciamento de conhecimento que utiliza o gh CLI para buscar e catalogar projetos no GitHub","ru":"github-kb - это инструмент управления знаниями, использующий gh CLI для поиска и каталогизации проектов на GitHub","ar":"github-kb هو أداة لإدارة المعرفة التي تستخدم واجهة سطر الأوامر gh للبحث وتسجيل المشاريع في GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Manages a local GitHub knowledge base via the gh CLI","Provides GitHub search capabilities for efficient project lookup","Utilizes the GITHUB_KB.md file to catalog all projects with brief descriptions","Supports environment variables for configuration, including GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH","Allows for optional GitHub Personal Access Token for private repositories","Catalogs projects in the KB directory with customizable path settings"],"zh":["支持gh CLI命令","提供GitHub本地知识库管理功能","支持私有仓库搜索","需要设置GITHUB_TOKEN环境变量","需要设置GITHUB_KB_PATH环境变量","支持本地知识库目录管理"],"ja":["gh CLIコマンドをサポート","GitHubのローカルナレッジベース管理機能を提供","プライベートリポジトリの検索をサポート","GITHUB_TOKEN環境変数の設定が必要","GITHUB_KB_PATH環境変数の設定が必要","ローカルナレッジベースディレクトリ管理をサポート"],"ko":["gh CLI 명령어 지원","GitHub 지식库 관리 기능 제공","비공개 저장소 검색 지원","GITHUB_TOKEN 환경 변수 설정 필요","GITHUB_KB_PATH 환경 변수 설정 필요","지식库 디렉토리 관리 지원"],"es":["Gestión de base de conocimiento local","Búsqueda en GitHub mediante la CLI de gh","Configuración de tokens de acceso para repositorios privados","Personalización del directorio de conocimiento","Compatibilidad con la CLI de gh para búsquedas avanzadas"],"fr":["Gestion d''une base de connaissances locale","Recherche sur GitHub via la CLI de gh","Configuration de jetons d''accès pour les dépôts privés","Personnalisation du répertoire de connaissances","Compatibilité avec la CLI de gh pour des recherches avancées"],"de":["Verwaltung eines lokalen Wissensrepositories","GitHub-Suche über die gh-CLI","Konfiguration von Zugriffstoken für private Repositorys","Anpassung des Wissensverzeichnisses","Kompatibilität mit der gh-CLI für erweiterte Suchen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de conhecimento local com GITHUB_KB.md","Pesquisa no GitHub via gh CLI","Configuração de tokens de acesso com GITHUB_TOKEN","Definição de caminhos de diretório com GITHUB_KB_PATH","Suporte a repositórios privados com tokens de acesso"],"ru":["Управление локальной базой знаний с GITHUB_KB.md","Поиск на GitHub через gh CLI","Настройка токенов доступа с GITHUB_TOKEN","Определение путей директории с GITHUB_KB_PATH","Поддержка приватных репозиториев с токенами доступа"],"ar":["إدارة المعرفة المحلية مع GITHUB_KB.md","البحث في GitHub عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","إعداد رموز الوصول مع GITHUB_TOKEN","تحديد مسارات الدليل مع GITHUB_KB_PATH","دعم للمستودعات الخاصة مع رموز الوصول"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use github-kb","github-kb setup guide","github-kb alternative","github knowledge base management","gh cli search capabilities","github-kb install","github-kb vs gitlab","github personal access token","local github knowledge base"],"zh":["github-kb","GitHub 知识库","gh CLI","私有仓库搜索","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH","AIエージェント","AI工具"],"ja":["github-kb","GitHub ナレッジベース","gh CLI","プライベートリポジトリ検索","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH","AIエージェント","AIツール"],"ko":["github-kb","GitHub 지식库","gh CLI","비공개 저장소 검색","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH","AI 에이전트","AI 툴"],"es":["github-kb","gestión de conocimiento","búsqueda en GitHub","CLI de gh","tokens de acceso","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","github search","knowledge management"],"fr":["github-kb","gestion des connaissances","recherche sur GitHub","CLI de gh","jetons d''accès","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","github search","knowledge management"],"de":["github-kb","Wissensmanagement","GitHub-Suche","gh-CLI","Zugriffstoken","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools","github search","knowledge management"],"pt":["github-kb","gerenciamento de conhecimento","gh CLI","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH","repositórios privados","configuração de tokens de acesso"],"ru":["github-kb","управление знаниями","gh CLI","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH","приватные репозитории","настройка токенов доступа"],"ar":["github-kb","إدارة المعرفة","واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","GITHUB_TOKEN","GITHUB_KB_PATH","المستودعات الخاصة","إعداد رموز الوصول"]}},"owner":"openclaw","repo":"skills","repoPath":"openclaw/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.264Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-kb","description":"Manage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Use when users ask about repos, PRs, issues, request to clone GitHub repositories, explore codebases, or need information about GitHub projects. Supports searching GitHub via gh CLI and managing local KB with GITHUB_KB.md catalog. Configure via GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH environment variables.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GIT","body":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GITHUB_KB_PATH=\"/your/path/github-kb\"\n```\n\n**Token Privacy:** Never hardcode tokens. Inject via environment variables or container secrets.\n\n## GitHub CLI (gh)\n\n**Requirement:** GitHub CLI must be installed and authenticated.\n\n**Installation:**\n- **macOS:** `brew install gh`\n- **Linux:** `apt install gh` or see [official install guide](https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/docs/install_linux.md)\n- **Windows:** `winget install GitHub.cli`\n\n**Authentication:**\n```bash\n# Interactive login\ngh auth login\n\n# Or use token from GITHUB_TOKEN env var\ngh auth login --with-token <(echo \"$GITHUB_TOKEN\")\n```\n\n**Verify:** `gh auth status`\n\nIf `gh` is not installed or not authenticated, skip search operations and use only local KB features.\n\n### Searching Repos\n\n```bash\n# Search repos by keyword\ngh search repos <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search repos \"typescript cli\" --limit 10\ngh search repos \"language:python stars:>1000\" --limit 20\ngh search repos \"topic:mcp\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by programming language\n- `stars:<n>` or `stars:><n>` - Filter by star count\n- `topic:<name>` - Filter by topic\n- `user:<owner>` - Search within a user''s repos\n- `org:<org>` - Search within an organization\n\n### Searching Issues\n\n```bash\ngh search issues \"react hooks bug\" --limit 20\ngh search issues \"repo:facebook/react state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search issues \"language:typescript label:bug\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed` - Filter by issue state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `comments:<n>` or `comments:><n>` - Filter by comment count\n\n### Searching Pull Requests\n\n```bash\n# Search PRs\ngh search prs <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search prs \"repo:vercel/next.js state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search prs \"language:go is:merged\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed|merged` - Filter by PR state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `is:merged|unmerged` - Filter by merge status\n\n### Viewing PR/Issue Details\n\n```bash\n# View issue/PR details\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\n\n# View with comments\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\n```\n\n## Local Knowledge Base Workflow\n\n### Querying About a Repo in KB\n\n1. Read GITHUB_KB.md to understand what projects exist\n2. Locate the project directory under ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/\n\n### Cloning a New Repo to KB\n\n1. Search GitHub if the full repo name is not known\n2. Clone to KB directory:\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<name>.git ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/<name>\n   ```\n3. Generate project description: Read README or key files to understand the project\n4. Update GITHUB_KB.md: Add entry for the new repo following the existing format:\n   ```markdown\n   ### [<name>](/<name>)\n   Brief one-line description of what the project does. Additional context if useful (key features, tech stack, etc.).\n   ```\n5. Confirm completion: Tell user the repo was cloned and where to find it\n\n### Default Clone Location\n\nIf user says \"clone X\" without specifying a directory, default to ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/.\n\n## GITHUB_KB.md Format\n\nThe catalog file follows this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nThis directory contains X GitHub projects covering various domains.\n\n---\n\n## Category Name\n\n### [project-name](/project-name)\nBrief description of the project.\n```\n\nMaintain categorization and consistent formatting when updating.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T01:59:41.761Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Management Agents requiring efficient GitHub repository cataloging and search functionalities via the gh CLI.","zh":"适合需要高效的GitHub仓库目录和搜索功能的代码管理代理，通过gh CLI实现。","ja":"GitHubリポジトリのカタログ作成と検索機能を効率的に行う必要があるコード管理エージェントに適しています。gh CLIを使用します。","ko":"코드 관리 에이전트에서 효율적인 GitHub 저장소 카탈로그 및 검색 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다. gh CLI를 통해 구현됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de código que requieren un catálogo eficiente de repositorios de GitHub y funcionalidades de búsqueda a través de la CLI de gh.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant un catalogage efficace des référentiels GitHub et des fonctionnalités de recherche via la CLI gh.","de":"Ideal für Code-Management-Agents, die ein effizientes GitHub-Repository-Verzeichnis und Suchfunktionen über die gh-CLI benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que requerem catalogação eficiente de repositórios do GitHub e funcionalidades de busca via o gh CLI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления кодом, требующих эффективного каталогизации репозиториев GitHub и функций поиска через gh CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الشفرة الذي يتطلب فهرسة مخازن GitHub بكفاءة ووظائف البحث من خلال واجهة سطر أوامر gh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage a local GitHub knowledge base, providing seamless project cataloging and GitHub search capabilities using environment variables like GITHUB_TOKEN for private repository access and GITHUB_KB_PATH for custom directory settings.","zh":"赋予代理管理本地GitHub知识库的能力，提供无缝的项目目录和GitHub搜索功能，使用环境变量如GITHUB_TOKEN进行私有仓库访问和GITHUB_KB_PATH进行自定义目录设置。","ja":"エージェントがローカルのGitHubナレッジベースを管理できるようにし、環境変数such as GITHUB_TOKENを使用したプライベートリポジトリへのアクセスとGITHUB_KB_PATHを使用したカスタムディレクトリ設定によるプロジェクトのカタログ作成とGitHub検索機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 GitHub 지식베이스를 관리할 수 있도록 해주며, GITHUB_TOKEN과 같은 환경 변수를 사용한 개인 저장소 접근 및 GITHUB_KB_PATH를 사용한 사용자 지정 디렉토리 설정에 의한 프로젝트 카탈로그 및 GitHub 검색 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar una base de conocimientos de GitHub local, proporcionando un catálogo de proyectos y capacidades de búsqueda de GitHub sin problemas, utilizando variables de entorno como GITHUB_TOKEN para el acceso a repositorios privados y GITHUB_KB_PATH para configuraciones de directorios personalizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer une base de connaissances GitHub locale, fournissant un catalogage de projets et des capacités de recherche GitHub sans interruption, en utilisant des variables d''environnement comme GITHUB_TOKEN pour l''accès aux référentiels privés et GITHUB_KB_PATH pour les paramètres de répertoire personnalisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, eine lokale GitHub-Wissensbasis zu verwalten, indem es ein nahtloses Projektverzeichnis und GitHub-Suchfunktionen bietet, unter Verwendung von Umgebungsvariablen wie GITHUB_TOKEN für den Zugriff auf private Repositorys und GITHUB_KB_PATH für benutzerdefinierte Verzeichniseinstellungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar uma base de conhecimento local do GitHub, fornecendo catalogação de projetos sem interrupção e capacidades de busca do GitHub usando variáveis de ambiente como GITHUB_TOKEN para acesso a repositórios privados e GITHUB_KB_PATH para configurações de diretório personalizadas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность управлять локальной базой знаний GitHub, обеспечивая беспрепятственную каталогизацию проектов и возможности поиска GitHub с использованием переменных окружения, таких как GITHUB_TOKEN для доступа к приватным репозиториям и GITHUB_KB_PATH для настроек пользовательского каталога.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إدارة قاعدة معرفة محلية لجيت هاب، وتوفير فهرسة مشروع