ботки PDF","Интеграция с Claude Agent SDK для приложений ИИ"],"ar":["قراءة ملفات PDF باستخدام pypdf","استخراج النص من ملفات PDF","إنشاء ملفات PDF مخصصة باستخدام Python","استخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر لمعالجة ملفات PDF","التكامل مع Claude Agent SDK لتطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use pdf with python","pdf processing with pypdf","pdf alternative to acrobat","pdf vs smallpdf","pdf install guide","pdf setup for ai agents","what is pdf processing","pdf automation with ai"],"zh":["PDF 处理","Python PDF 库","命令行工具 PDF","AI エージェント PDF","PDF 文本提取","pypdf 库","PDF 处理最佳实践"],"ja":["PDF 処理","Python PDF ライブラリ","コマンドライン ツール PDF","AI エージェント PDF","PDF テキスト抽出","pypdf ライブラリ","PDF 処理ベスト プラクティス"],"ko":["PDF 처리","Python PDF 라이브러리","CLI 도구 PDF","AI 에이전트 PDF","PDF 텍스트 추출","pypdf 라이브러리","PDF 처리_best_practices"],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","herramientas de línea de comandos para pdf","entornos de trabajo de ia de escritorio","goodable","pypdf","ia y pdf","desarrollo de aplicaciones de ia","pdf y python"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","outils de ligne de commande pour pdf","espaces de travail d''ia de bureau","goodable","pypdf","ia et pdf","développement d''applications d''ia","pdf et python"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","kommandozeilen-tools für pdf","desktop-ia-arbeitsumgebungen","goodable","pypdf","ki und pdf","entwicklung von ki-anwendungen","pdf und python"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","python pdf","pypdf","extração de texto pdf","criação de pdf","ferramentas de linha de comando pdf","ia e pdf","claude agent sdk"],"ru":["обработка pdf","python pdf","pypdf","извлечение текста pdf","создание pdf","командная строка pdf","ии и pdf","claude agent sdk"],"ar":["معالجة ملفات pdf","python pdf","pypdf","استخراج النص من ملفات pdf","إنشاء ملفات pdf","أدوات سطر الأوامر pdf","ذكاء اصطناعي وملفات pdf","claude agent sdk"]}},"owner":"ImGoodBai","repo":"goodable","repoPath":"ImGoodBai/goodable","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.270Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"Comprehensive PDF manipulation toolkit for extracting text and tables, creating new PDFs, merging/splitting documents, and handling forms. When Claude needs to fill in a PDF form or programmatically process, generate, or analyze PDF documents at scale.","bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- For troubleshooting guides, see reference.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:09.397Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities using Python libraries like pypdf.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Python库（如pypdf）进行高级PDF处理的文档分析代理。","ja":"Pythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用した高度なPDF処理機能を必要とする文書分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용한 고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas utilizando bibliotecas de Python como pypdf.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de documents nécessitant des fonctionnalités de traitement de PDF avancées en utilisant des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf.","de":"Perfekt für Document Analysis Agents, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen mit Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python como pypdf.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа документов, которым требуются расширенные возможности обработки PDF с помощью библиотек Python, таких как pypdf.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل المستندات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لمعالجة PDF باستخدام مكتبات Python مثل pypdf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text, read PDF documents, and perform essential PDF processing operations using command-line tools and Python libraries like pypdf, enabling efficient automation of PDF tasks.","zh":"赋予代理从PDF文档中提取文本、读取PDF文档并使用命令行工具和Python库（如pypdf）执行基本的PDF处理操作，实现PDF任务的高效自动化。","ja":"エージェントがPDF文書からテキストを抽出して読み取り、コマンドラインツールおよびPythonライブラリ（pypdfなど）を使用して基本的なPDF処理操作を実行できるようにし、PDFタスクの効率的な自動化を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 PDF 문서에서 텍스트를 추출하고 PDF 문서를 읽어들이고 명령줄 도구와 Python 라이브러리(pypdf 등)를 사용하여 기본적인 PDF 처리 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 해주어 PDF 작업의 효율적인 자동화를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto, leer documentos PDF y realizar operaciones de procesamiento de PDF esenciales utilizando herramientas de línea de comandos y bibliotecas de Python como pypdf, lo que permite la automatización eficiente de tareas de PDF.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte, de lire des documents PDF et de réaliser des opérations de traitement de PDF essentielles en utilisant des outils de ligne de commande et des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf, permettant ainsi une automation efficace des tâches de PDF.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Text zu extrahieren, PDF-Dokumente zu lesen und wesentliche PDF-Verarbeitungsoperationen mit Befehlszeilenwerkzeugen und Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf durchzuführen, was eine effiziente Automatisierung von PDF-Aufgaben ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto, ler documentos PDF e realizar operações de processamento de PDF essenciais usando ferramentas de linha de comando e bibliotecas Python como pypdf, permitindo a automação eficiente de tarefas de PDF.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст, читать документы PDF и выполнять основные операции обработки PDF с помощью утилит командной строки и библиотек Python, таких как pypdf, обеспечивая эффективную автоматизацию задач PDF.","ar":"تمكن العميل من استخراج النص ، قراءة مستندات PDF ، وأداء عمليات معالجة PDF الأساسية باستخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر ومكتبات Python مثل pypdf ، مما يتيح التأهيل الفعال لمهام PDF."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from PDF documents","Automating PDF form filling","Reading and analyzing PDF content"],"zh":["从PDF文档中提取文本","自动填充PDF表单","读取和分析PDF内容"],"ja":["PDF文書からテキストを抽出する","PDFフォームの自動入力","PDFコンテンツの読み取りと分析"],"ko":["PDF 문서에서 텍스트 추출하기","PDF 양식 자동填充","PDF 내용 읽기 및 분석"],"es":["Extraer texto de documentos PDF","Automatizar el llenado de formularios PDF","Leer y analizar contenido de PDF"],"fr":["Extraire du texte de documents PDF","Automatiser le remplissage de formulaires PDF","Lire et analyser le contenu de PDF"],"de":["Text aus PDF-Dokumenten extrahieren","PDF-Formulare automatisch ausfüllen","PDF-Inhalt lesen und analysieren"],"pt":["Extrair texto de documentos PDF","Automatizar preenchimento de formulários PDF","Ler e analisar conteúdo PDF"],"ru":["Извлечение текста из документов PDF","Автоматизация заполнения форм PDF","Чтение и анализ содержимого PDF"],"ar":["استخراج النص من مستندات PDF","تأهيل تعبئة استمارة PDF","قراءة وتحليل محتوى PDF"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to PDF format","Dependent on pypdf library"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限PDF格式","依赖于pypdf库"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","PDF形式のみ","pypdfライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","PDF 형식만 해당","pypdf 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado al formato PDF","Dependiente de la biblioteca pypdf"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité au format PDF","Dépendant de la bibliothèque pypdf"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf PDF-Format","Abhängig von der Bibliothek pypdf"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado ao formato PDF","Dependente da biblioteca pypdf"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничен форматом PDF","Зависит от библиотеки pypdf"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بتنسيق PDF","يعتمد على مكتبة pypdf"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7527c4dfe4e2ea0d524a6768f607cbf5e0e23fe4424520ce49fab93791b6f7fa","qualityScore":45}');
