aft III Peon语音通知工具，用于配置和管理音频设置","ja":"peon-ping-configは、Warcraft III Peonの音声通知を管理するためのAIエージェントです","ko":"peon-ping-config는 워크래프트 III Peon 음성 알림을 구성하고 관리하는 도구입니다","es":"peon-ping-config es una herramienta de configuración para notificaciones de voz en entornos de desarrollo","fr":"peon-ping-config est un outil de configuration pour les notifications vocales dans les environnements de développement","de":"peon-ping-config ist ein Konfigurationswerkzeug für Sprachbenachrichtigungen in Entwicklungsumgebungen","pt":"O Peon-Ping-Config é uma ferramenta de configuração que permite personalizar notificações de voz e outros recursos para Claude Code e Codex","ru":"Peon-Ping-Config - это инструмент конфигурации, который позволяет настраивать голосовые уведомления и другие функции для Claude Code и Codex","ar":"Peon-Ping-Config هو أداة إعدادات تتيح تخصيص الإشعارات الصوتية والميزات الأخرى لمنصات Claude Code و Codex"},"features":{"en":["Configurable sound volume via the volume setting in config.json","Support for multiple sound packs, including ''peon'', ''sc_kerrigan'', and ''glados''","Master on/off switch using the enabled setting","Pack rotation feature for randomizing sound packs per session","Config file location at ${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json"],"zh":["配置音量（0.0-1.0）","选择声音包（例如\"peon\"、\"sc_kerrigan\"、\"glados\"）","启用或禁用音频通知","设置声音包轮换功能","支持JSON配置文件"],"ja":["音量（0.0-1.0）を設定","サウンドパック（例：\"peon\"、\"sc_kerrigan\"、\"glados\"）を選択","音声通知をオン/オフする","サウンドパックのローテーション機能を設定","JSON設定ファイルをサポート"],"ko":["음량（0.0-1.0）을 구성","사운드 팩（예：\"peon\"、\"sc_kerrigan\"、\"glados\"）을 선택","음성 알림을 활성화 또는 비활성화","사운드 팩 회전 기능을 설정","JSON 구성 파일을 지원"],"es":["Configuración de volumen de sonido","Selección de paquete de sonido activo","Activación/desactivación de notificaciones","Rotación de paquetes de sonido por sesión","Configuración a través de archivo JSON"],"fr":["Configuration du volume sonore","Sélection du pack de sons actif","Activation/désactivation des notifications","Rotation des packs de sons par session","Configuration via fichier JSON"],"de":["Lautstärkeeinstellung","Auswahl des aktiven Sound-Pakets","Aktivierung/Deaktivierung von Benachrichtigungen","Rotation von Sound-Paketen pro Sitzung","Konfiguration über JSON-Datei"],"pt":["Notificações de voz personalizadas com suporte a pacotes de som","Configuração de volume e ativação/desativação de notificações","Rotação de pacotes de som por sessão","Arquivo de configuração em formato JSON","Integração com Claude Code e Codex"],"ru":["Настраиваемые голосовые уведомления с поддержкой звуковых пакетов","Настройка громкости и включение/выключение уведомлений","Ротация звуковых пакетов за сессию","Файл конфигурации в формате JSON","Интеграция с Claude Code и Codex"],"ar":["إشعارات صوتية مخصصة بدعم για حزم الصوت","إعدادات الصوت وتفعيل/إلغاء تفعيل الإشعارات","دورة حزم الصوت لكل جلسة","ملف الإعدادات بالصيغة JSON","التكامل مع منصات Claude Code و Codex"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use peon-ping-config","peon-ping-config setup guide","what is peon-ping-config","peon-ping-config alternative","peon-ping-config vs custom voice notifications","configuring peon-ping-config for Claude Code","installing peon-ping-config for Codex","peon-ping-config sound pack rotation","customizing peon-ping-config voice notifications"],"zh":["peon-ping-config","Warcraft III Peon语音通知","AI工具","音频配置","JSON配置文件","开发效率","终端通知"],"ja":["peon-ping-config","Warcraft III Peon音声通知","AIエージェント","音声設定","JSON設定ファイル","開発生産性","ターミナル通知"],"ko":["peon-ping-config","워크래프트 III Peon 음성 알림","AI 도구","음향 구성","JSON 구성 파일","개발 효율","터미널 알림"],"es":["peon-ping-config","notificaciones de voz","Claude Code","Codex","configuración de sonido","herramientas de desarrollo","Agentes de IA para desarrollo","configuración de volumen","paquetes de sonido"],"fr":["peon-ping-config","notifications vocales","Claude Code","Codex","configuration sonore","outils de développement","Agents IA pour le développement","configuration de volume","packs de sons"],"de":["peon-ping-config","Sprachbenachrichtigungen","Claude Code","Codex","Sound-Konfiguration","Entwicklungstools","KI-Agents für Entwicklung","Lautstärkeeinstellung","Sound-Pakete"],"pt":["Peon-Ping-Config","configuração de notificações"," Claude Code","Codex","notificações de voz","pacotes de som","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade de desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Peon-Ping-Config","настройка уведомлений","Claude Code","Codex","голосовые уведомления","звуковые пакеты","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность разработчиков","инструменты разработки","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Peon-Ping-Config","إعدادات الإشعارات","Claude Code","Codex","إشعارات صوتية","حزم الصوت","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية المطورين","أدوات التطوير","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"PeonPing","repo":"peon-ping","repoPath":"PeonPing/peon-ping","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.276Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"peon-ping-config","description":"Update peon-ping configuration — volume, pack rotation, categories, active pack, and other settings. Use when user wants to change peon-ping settings like volume, enable round-robin, add packs to rotation, toggle sound categories, or adjust any config.","bodyPreview":"# peon-ping-config\n\nUpdate peon-ping configuration settings.\n\n## Config location\n\nThe config file is at `${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json`.\n\n## Available settings\n\n- **volume** (number, 0.0–1.0): Sound volume\n- **active_pack** (string): Current sound pack name (e.g. `\"peon\"`, `\"sc_kerrigan\"`, `\"glados\"`)\n- **enabled** (boolean): Master on/off switch\n- **pack_rotation** (array of strings): List of packs to rotate through per session. Empty `[]` uses `active_pack` on","body":"# peon-ping-config\n\nUpdate peon-ping configuration settings.\n\n## Config location\n\nThe config file is at `${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}/hooks/peon-ping/config.json`.\n\n## Available settings\n\n- **volume** (number, 0.0–1.0): Sound volume\n- **active_pack** (string): Current sound pack name (e.g. `\"peon\"`, `\"sc_kerrigan\"`, `\"glados\"`)\n- **enabled** (boolean): Master on/off switch\n- **pack_rotation** (array of strings): List of packs to rotate through per session. Empty `[]` uses `active_pack` only.\n- **pack_rotation_mode** (string): `\"random\"` (default) picks a random pack each session. `\"round-robin\"` cycles through in order. `\"agentskill\"` uses explicit per-session assignments from `/peon-ping-use`; invalid or missing packs fall back to `active_pack` and the stale assignment is removed.\n- **categories** (object): Toggle individual CESP sound categories:\n  - `session.start`, `task.acknowledge`, `task.complete`, `task.error`, `input.required`, `resource.limit`, `user.spam` — each a boolean\n- **annoyed_threshold** (number): How many rapid prompts trigger user.spam sounds\n- **annoyed_window_seconds** (number): Time window for the annoyed threshold\n- **silent_window_seconds** (number): Suppress task.complete sounds for tasks shorter than this many seconds\n- **session_ttl_days** (number, default: 7): Expire stale per-session pack assignments older than N days (when using agentskill mode)\n- **desktop_notifications** (boolean): Toggle notification popups independently from sounds (default: `true`)\n- **use_sound_effects_device** (boolean): Route audio through macOS Sound Effects device (`true`) or default output via afplay (`false`). Only affects macOS. Default: `true`\n\n## How to update\n\n1. Read the config file using the Read tool\n2. Edit the relevant field(s) using the Edit tool\n3. Confirm the change to the user\n\n## Common Configuration Examples\n\n### Disable desktop notification popups but keep sounds\n\n**User request:** \"Disable desktop notifications\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet `desktop_notifications: false` in config\n\n**Result:**\n- ✅ Sounds continue playing (voice reminders)\n- ❌ Desktop notification popups suppressed\n- ✅ Mobile notifications unaffected (separate toggle)\n\n**Alternative CLI command:**\n```bash\npeon notifications off\n# or\npeon popups off\n```\n\n### Adjust volume\n\n**User request:** \"Set volume to 30%\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet `volume: 0.3` in config\n\n### Enable round-robin pack rotation\n\n**User request:** \"Enable round-robin pack rotation with peon and glados\"\n\n**Action:**\nSet:\n```json\n{\n  \"pack_rotation\": [\"peon\", \"glados\"],\n  \"pack_rotation_mode\": \"round-robin\"\n}\n```\n\n## Directory pack bindings\n\nPermanently associate a sound pack with a working directory so every session in that directory uses the right pack automatically. Uses the `path_rules` config key (array of `{ \"pattern\": \"<glob>\", \"pack\": \"<name>\" }` objects).\n\n### CLI commands\n\n```bash\n# Bind a pack to the current directory\npeon packs bind <pack>\n# e.g. peon packs bind glados\n# → bound glados to /Users/dan/Frontend\n\n# Bind with a custom glob pattern (matches any dir with that name)\npeon packs bind <pack> --pattern \"*/Frontend/*\"\n\n# Auto-download a missing pack and bind it\npeon packs bind <pack> --install\n\n# Remove binding for the current directory\npeon packs unbind\n\n# Remove a specific pattern binding\npeon packs unbind --pattern \"*/Frontend/*\"\n\n# List all bindings (* marks rules matching current directory)\npeon packs bindings\n```\n\n### Manual config\n\nThe `path_rules` array in `config.json` can also be edited directly:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"path_rules\": [\n    { \"pattern\": \"/Users/dan/Frontend/*\", \"pack\": \"glados\" },\n    { \"pattern\": \"*/backend/*\", \"pack\": \"sc_kerrigan\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nPatterns use Python `fnmatch` glob syntax. First matching rule wins. Path rules override `default_pack` and `pack_rotation` but are overridden by `session_override` (agentskill) assignments.\n\n## List available packs\n\nTo show available packs, run:\n\n```bash\nbash \"${CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR:-$HOME/.claude}\"/hooks/peon-ping/peon.sh packs list\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:39.151Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Productivity Agents automating terminal monitoring with auditory feedback.","zh":"非常适合用于提升开发者生产力的AI Agent，通过声音反馈实现终端监控自动化。","ja":"開発者の生産性を高めるAI Agentに最適で、音声フィードバックによるターミナル監視の自動化を実現します。","ko":"개발자 생산성 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합하며, 청각적 피드백으로 터미널 모니터링을 자동화합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Productividad de Desarrolladores que automatizan la monitorización de terminal con comentarios auditivos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Productivité des Développeurs qui automatisent la surveillance du terminal avec des commentaires auditifs.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler-Produktivitätsagenten, die die Terminal-Überwachung mit auditiven Kommentaren automatisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade de Desenvolvedor que automatizam a monitoração do terminal com feedback auditivo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов производительности разработчиков, автоматизирующих мониторинг терминала с помощью звуковой обратной связи.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إنتاجية المطورين الذي يقوم بتشغيل مراقبة الطرفية مع ملاحظات صوتية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables auditory workflow automation by playing Warcraft III Peon voice notifications for Claude Code and Codex events. Provides configurable volume control, sound pack rotation, and master enable/disable functionality through a JSON configuration file.","zh":"通过播放Warcraft III Peon语音通知来响应Claude Code和Codex事件，从而实现听觉工作流程自动化。通过JSON配置文件提供可配置的音量控制、声音包轮换和主启用/禁用功能。","ja":"Claude CodeおよびCodexのイベントに対してWarcraft III Peonの音声通知を再生することで、聴覚的なワークフロー自動化を実現します。JSON設定ファイルを通じて、設定可能な音量コントロール、サウンドパックのローテーション、マスターの有効化/無効化機能を提供します。","ko":"Claude Code 및 Codex 이벤트에 대해 Warcraft III Peon 음성 알림을 재생하여 청각적 워크플로우 자동화를 가능하게 합니다. JSON 구성 파일을 통해 구성 가능한 볼륨 제어, 사운드 팩 순환 및 마스터 사용/사용 안 함 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita la automatización del flujo de trabajo auditivo reproduciendo notificaciones de voz de Peon de Warcraft III para eventos de Claude Code y Codex. Proporciona control de volumen configurable, rotación de paquetes de sonido y funcionalidad de habilitación/deshabilitación maestra a través de un archivo de configuración JSON.","fr":"Permet l''automatisation du workflow auditif en jouant des notifications vocales de Peon de Warcraft III pour les événements de Claude Code et Codex. Fournit un contrôle de volume configurable, une rotation de packs de sons et une fonctionnalité d''activation/désactivation maître via un fichier de configuration JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht die Automatisierung des Auditiv-Workflows durch Abspielen von Warcraft-III-Peon-Sprachbenachrichtigungen für Claude-Code- und Codex-Ereignisse. Bietet konfigurierbare Lautstärke, Soundpack-Rotation und Master-Aktivierung/Deaktivierungsfunktion über eine JSON-Konfigurationsdatei.","pt":"Habilita a automação do fluxo de trabalho auditivo, reproduzindo notificações de voz do Peon do Warcraft III para eventos do Claude Code e Codex. Fornece controle de volume configurável, rotação de pacotes de som e funcionalidade de ativação/desativação principal por meio de um arquivo de configuração JSON.","ru":"Позволяет автоматизировать звуковой рабочий процесс, воспроизводя уведомления голосом Peon из Warcraft III для событий Claude Code и Codex. Предоставляет настраиваемый контроль громкости, вращение пакетов звука и функцию включения/выключения через файл конфигурации JSON.","ar":"يمكن تسهيل عمليات تدفق العمل الصوتية من خلال تشغيل إشعارات صوتية لصوت Peon من Warcraft III للأحداث Claude Code و Codex. يوفر التحكم في مستوى الصوت القابل للتهيئة وتدوير حزمة الصوت ووظيفة تمكين/إلغاء التمكين الرئيسية من خلال ملف تكوين JSON"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating terminal monitoring with sound notifications","Rotating voice packs per development session","Configuring audio feedback volume levels programmatically"],"zh":["使用声音通知自动化终端监控","每个开发会话轮换语音包","以编程方式配置音频反馈音量级别"],"ja":["音声通知によるターミナル監視の自動化","開発セッションごとの音声パックのローテーション","プログラムによるオーディオフィードバックの音量レベルの設定"],"ko":["사운드 알림으로 터미널 모니터링 자동화","개발 세션별 음성 팩 순환","프로그래밍 방식으로 오디오 피드백 볼륨 레벨 구성"],"es":["Automatizar la monitorización de terminal con notificaciones de sonido","Rotar paquetes de voz por sesión de desarrollo","Configurar los niveles de volumen de la retroalimentación de audio de forma programática"],"fr":["Automatiser la surveillance du terminal avec des notifications sonores","Faire pivoter les packs de voix par session de développement","Configurer les niveaux de volume de la rétroaction audio de manière programmatique"],"de":["Automatisieren der Terminal-Überwachung mit Sound-Benachrichtigungen","Rotation von Sprachpaketen pro Entwicklungs-Session","Konfigurieren der Audioretroalimentations-Volumenebenen programmatisch"],"pt":["Automatizar a monitoração do terminal com notificações sonoras","Rotacionar pacotes de voz por sessão de desenvolvimento","Configurar níveis de volume de feedback de áudio programaticamente"],"ru":["Автоматизировать мониторинг терминала с помощью звуковых уведомлений","Поворачивать пакеты голоса для каждой сессии разработки","Настроить уровни громкости аудио-обратной связи программно"],"ar":["التشغيل التلقائي لمراقبة الطرفية مع إشعارات صوتية","تدوير حزم الصوت لكل جلسة تنمية","تهيئة مستويات صوت ملاحظات الصوت برمجي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude configuration directory structure","Dependent on specific sound pack availability","Limited to JSON configuration file format"],"zh":["需要Claude配置目录结构","依赖于特定声音包的可用性","仅限于JSON配置文件格式"],"ja":["Claudeの設定ディレクトリ構造が必要","特定のサウンドパックの可用性に依存","JSON設定ファイル形式に限定"],"ko":["Claude 구성 디렉토리 구조 필요","특정 사운드 팩 가용성에 의존","JSON 구성 파일 형식으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere estructura de directorio de configuración de Claude","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de un paquete de sonido específico","Limitado al formato de archivo de configuración JSON"],"fr":["Nécessite une structure de répertoire de configuration de Claude","Dépend de la disponibilité d''un pack de sons spécifique","Limité au format de fichier de configuration JSON"],"de":["Benötigt Verzeichnisstruktur für Claude-Konfiguration","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit eines bestimmten Sound-Packs","Begrenzt auf JSON-Konfigurationsdatei-Format"],"pt":["Exige estrutura de diretório de configuração do Claude","Dependente da disponibilidade de pacotes de som específicos","Limitado ao formato de arquivo de configuração JSON"],"ru":["Требует структуры каталога конфигурации Claude","Зависит от наличия конкретных пакетов звука","Ограничен форматом файла конфигурации JSON"],"ar":["يتطلب هيكل دليل تكوين Claude","يعتمد على توافر حزم صوت محددة","محدود بتهيئة ملف JSON"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4b2ff0c13199d1cfd65c2a7930d31368464b6fe0194db14b3e064f18bf5f58a5","qualityScore":45}');
