IA","amélioration de travaux d''IA","IA Agents","Outils d''automatisation d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","KI-Arbeitsabläufe","deepwork_jobs","Erstellung von Arbeitsabläufen","Verwaltung von KI-Jobs","Core-Befehle für KI","Aufruf von Schritten in KI","Verbesserung von KI-Jobs","KI-Agents","Automatisierungstools für KI"],"pt":["DeepWork Jobs","fluxo de trabalho em multi-etapas","criação de trabalhos","gerenciamento de trabalhos","comandos core","aprendizado com execução","Skill tool","ferramenta de workflow"],"ru":["DeepWork Jobs","многоступенчатый рабочий процесс","создание задач","управление задачами","основные команды","обучение на выполнении","ИИ Агенты","Skill tool","инструмент рабочего процесса"],"ar":["DeepWork Jobs","سير عمل متعددة المراحل","إنشاء وظائف","إدارة وظائف","أوامر أساسية","التعلم من تشغيل","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","Skill tool","أداة سير العمل"]}},"owner":"EONMUN","repo":"EONMUN","repoPath":"EONMUN/EONMUN","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.301Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deepwork_jobs","description":"Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.","bodyPreview":"# deepwork_jobs\n\n**Multi-step workflow**: Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.\n\n> **CRITICAL**: Always invoke steps using the Skill tool. Never copy/paste step instructions directly.\n\nCore commands for managing DeepWork jobs. These commands help you define new multi-step\nworkflows and learn from running them.\n\nThe `define` command guides you through an interactive process to create a new job by\nasking structured questions about","body":"# deepwork_jobs\n\n**Multi-step workflow**: Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.\n\n> **CRITICAL**: Always invoke steps using the Skill tool. Never copy/paste step instructions directly.\n\nCore commands for managing DeepWork jobs. These commands help you define new multi-step\nworkflows and learn from running them.\n\nThe `define` command guides you through an interactive process to create a new job by\nasking structured questions about your workflow, understanding each step''s inputs and outputs,\nand generating all necessary files.\n\nThe `learn` command reflects on conversations where DeepWork jobs were run, identifies\nconfusion or inefficiencies, and improves job instructions. It also captures bespoke\nlearnings specific to the current run into AGENTS.md files in the working folder.\n\n\n## Available Steps\n\n1. **define** - Creates a job.yml specification by gathering workflow requirements through structured questions. Use when starting a new multi-step workflow.\n2. **review_job_spec** - Reviews job.yml against quality criteria using a sub-agent for unbiased validation. Use after defining a job specification. (requires: define)\n3. **implement** - Generates step instruction files and syncs slash commands from the job.yml specification. Use after job spec review passes. (requires: review_job_spec)\n4. **learn** - Analyzes conversation history to improve job instructions and capture learnings. Use after running a job to refine it.\n\n## Execution Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Intent\n\nParse any text following `/deepwork_jobs` to determine user intent:\n- \"define\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.define`\n- \"review_job_spec\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.review_job_spec`\n- \"implement\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.implement`\n- \"learn\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.learn`\n\n### Step 2: Invoke Starting Step\n\nUse the Skill tool to invoke the identified starting step:\n```\nSkill tool: deepwork_jobs.define\n```\n\n### Step 3: Continue Workflow Automatically\n\nAfter each step completes:\n1. Check if there''s a next step in the sequence\n2. Invoke the next step using the Skill tool\n3. Repeat until workflow is complete or user intervenes\n\n### Handling Ambiguous Intent\n\nIf user intent is unclear, use AskUserQuestion to clarify:\n- Present available steps as numbered options\n- Let user select the starting point\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Do NOT copy/paste step instructions directly; always use the Skill tool to invoke steps\n- Do NOT skip steps in the workflow unless the user explicitly requests it\n- Do NOT proceed to the next step if the current step''s outputs are incomplete\n- Do NOT make assumptions about user intent; ask for clarification when ambiguous\n\n## Context Files\n\n- Job definition: `.deepwork/jobs/deepwork_jobs/job.yml`"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:01:37.201Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Workflow Agents needing multi-step DeepWork job management capabilities.","zh":"适合需要多步骤 DeepWork 工作管理功能的 AI Workflow Agents。","ja":"マルチステップの DeepWork ジョブ管理機能を必要とする AI Workflow Agents に最適です。","ko":"다단계 DeepWork 작업 관리 기능이 필요한 AI Workflow 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de flujo de trabajo de IA que necesitan capacidades de gestión de trabajos DeepWork de varios pasos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de workflow d''IA ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de travail DeepWork à plusieurs étapes.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Workflow-Agents, die Funktionen zur Verwaltung von DeepWork-Jobs mit mehreren Schritten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Fluxo de Trabalho de IA que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de trabalhos DeepWork multi-etapa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов рабочего процесса ИИ, которым необходимы возможности управления задачами DeepWork с несколькими шагами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء في عمليات العمل الإلكتروني التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة مهام DeepWork متعددة الخطوات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define, implement, and improve DeepWork jobs through interactive workflows, utilizing core commands for job management and learning from execution, all while ensuring consistency by invoking steps via the Skill tool.","zh":"赋予代理定义、实现和改进 DeepWork 工作的能力，通过交互式工作流来实现，这些工作流利用核心命令来管理工作和从执行中学习，同时通过 Skill 工具调用步骤来确保一致性。","ja":"エージェントが DeepWork ジョブを定義、実装、改善できるようにし、インタラクティブなワークフローを使用してコアコマンドでジョブ管理と実行からの学習を行い、Skill ツールを介してステップを呼び出して一貫性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 DeepWork 작업을 정의, 구현 및 개선할 수 있도록 해주며, 상호 작용형 워크플로우를 사용하여 코어 명령을 통해 작업 관리 및 실행에서 학습을 수행하고, Skill 도구를 통해 일관성을 보장하기 위해 단계를 호출합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir, implementar y mejorar trabajos DeepWork a través de flujos de trabajo interactivos, utilizando comandos básicos para la gestión de trabajos y el aprendizaje de la ejecución, todo mientras se garantiza la consistencia invocando pasos a través de la herramienta Skill.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir, de mettre en œuvre et d''améliorer les travaux DeepWork à l''aide de flux de travail interactifs, en utilisant des commandes de base pour la gestion des travaux et l''apprentissage de l''exécution, le tout en garantissant la cohérence en invoquant les étapes via l''outil Skill.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, DeepWork-Jobs über interaktive Workflows zu definieren, umzusetzen und zu verbessern, indem sie Core-Befehle für die Jobverwaltung und das Lernen aus der Ausführung nutzen, und dabei durch die Invocation von Schritten über das Skill-Tool Konsistenz sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir, implementar e melhorar os trabalhos DeepWork por meio de fluxos de trabalho interativos, utilizando comandos principais para gerenciamento de trabalhos e aprendizado com a execução, garantindo a consistência ao invocar etapas por meio da ferramenta Skill.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять, реализовывать и улучшать задачи DeepWork посредством интерактивных рабочих процессов, используя основные команды для управления задачами и обучения на основе выполнения, обеспечивая при этом согласованность путем вызова шагов через инструмент Skill.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تعريف وتنفيذ وتحسين مهام DeepWork من خلال سير عمل تفاعلية، باستخدام أوامر رئيسية لإدارة المهام والتعلم من التنفيذ، مع ضمان الاتساق من خلال استدعاء الخطوات عبر أداة المهارة."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining new multi-step AI workflows","Implementing and improving existing DeepWork jobs","Learning from running jobs through structured analysis"],"zh":["定义新的多步骤 AI 工作流","实现和改进现有的 DeepWork 工作","通过结构化分析从运行的工作中学习"],"ja":["新しいマルチステップ AI ワークフローの定義","既存の DeepWork ジョブの実装と改善","構造化分析を使用して実行中のジョブから学習"],"ko":["새로운 다단계 AI 워크플로우 정의","既存의 DeepWork 작업 구현 및 개선","구조화된 분석을 통해 실행중인 작업에서 학습"],"es":["Definir nuevos flujos de trabajo de IA de varios pasos","Implementar y mejorar trabajos DeepWork existentes","Aprender de trabajos en ejecución a través de un análisis estructurado"],"fr":["Définir de nouveaux flux de travail d''IA à plusieurs étapes","Mettre en œuvre et améliorer les travaux DeepWork existants","Apprendre des travaux en cours d''exécution via une analyse structurée"],"de":["Neue AI-Workflows mit mehreren Schritten definieren","Vorhandene DeepWork-Jobs implementieren und verbessern","Aus laufenden Jobs durch strukturierte Analyse lernen"],"pt":["Definir novos fluxos de trabalho de IA multi-etapa","Implementar e melhorar os trabalhos DeepWork existentes","Aprender com os trabalhos em execução por meio de análise estruturada"],"ru":["Определение новых многоэтапных рабочих процессов ИИ","Реализация и улучшение существующих задач DeepWork","Обучение на основе выполнения задач посредством структурированного анализа"],"ar":["تحديد سلاسل عمل إلكترونية جديدة متعددة الخطوات","تنفيذ وتحسين مهام DeepWork الحالية","التعلم من المهام المنفذة من خلال تحليل منظم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires invocation of steps using the Skill tool, never via copy/paste"],"zh":["需要使用 Skill 工具调用步骤，不能通过复制/粘贴"],"ja":["Skill ツールを使用してステップを呼び出す必要があり、コピー/ペーストでは呼び出せない"],"ko":["Skill 도구를 사용하여 단계를 호출해야 하며, 복사/貼付으로 호출할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere la invocación de pasos utilizando la herramienta Skill, nunca a través de copiar/pegar"],"fr":["Nécessite l''invocation d''étapes à l''aide de l''outil Skill, jamais via copier/coller"],"de":["Erfordert die Invocation von Schritten unter Verwendung des Skill-Tools, niemals via Kopieren/Einfügen"],"pt":["Requer a invocação de etapas usando a ferramenta Skill, nunca via cópia/colar"],"ru":["Требует вызова шагов с помощью инструмента Skill, никогда не через копирование/вставку"],"ar":["يتطلب استدعاء الخطوات باستخدام أداة المهارة، أبدا عن طريق نسخ ولصق"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"aecfdc18f3e7bc78dc1cb4b33115b970a1be6b403e7d2c507bd710abec3c1c9f","qualityScore":45}');
