INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Redth/MAUI.Sherpa/maui-ai-debugging', 'maui-ai-debugging', 'Redth', 'MAUI.Sherpa', 'community', 'maui-ai-debugging Redth MAUI.Sherpa community The maui-ai-debugging skill enables a complete feedback loop for .NET MAUI app development, allowing developers to build, deploy, inspect, and debug apps from the terminal. MAUI AI调试工具提供了.NET MAUI应用的构建、部署、检查和调试功能。使用CLI命令行工具来管理您的开发环境 MAUI AIデバッグツールは、.NET MAUIアプリのビルド、デプロイ、検査、デバッグ機能を提供します。CLIコマンドラインツールを使用して開発環境を管理します MAUI AI 디버깅 도구는 .NET MAUI 애플리케이션의 빌드, 배포, 검사 및 디버깅 기능을 제공합니다. CLI 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 개발 환경을 관리합니다 MAUI AI Debugging permite una retroalimentación completa para aplicaciones .NET MAUI: construir, implementar, inspeccionar y depurar desde la terminal MAUI AI Debugging permet une boucle de rétroaction complète pour les applications .NET MAUI : construire, déployer, inspecter et déboguer depuis le terminal MAUI-AI-Debugging ermöglicht eine vollständige Rückmeldeschleife für .NET-MAUI-Anwendungen: Erstellen, Bereitstellen, Untersuchen und Debuggen von der Terminal aus O MAUI Sherpa oferece uma solução completa para debugging de AI MAUI em .NET MAUI, permitindo um ciclo de feedback completo: build, deploy, inspect, fix e rebuild. MAUI Sherpa предоставляет полное решение для отладки ИИ MAUI в .NET MAUI, позволяя выполнить полный цикл обратной связи: build, deploy, inspect, fix и rebuild. يقدم MAUI Sherpa حلًا كاملاً لأداة Debugging للذكاء الاصطناعي MAUI في .NET MAUI، مما يسمح بتحقيق دورة تغذية راجعة كاملة: build، deploy، inspect، fix و rebuild. how to use maui-ai-debugging maui-ai-debugging install maui-ai-debugging setup guide what is maui-ai-debugging maui-ai-debugging alternative maui-ai-debugging vs traditional debugging methods MAUI AI调试工具 NET MAUI应用调试 终端调试工具 CLI命令行工具 Android和iOS/Mac开发 dotnet tool install update-skill命令 Enables build, deploy, inspect, and debug operations for .NET MAUI apps via the terminal Supports installation and updates via dotnet tool install and update commands Requires Redth.MauiDevFlow.CLI and androidsdk.tool/appledev.tools for Android and iOS/Mac development Allows for skill updates using the maui-devflow update-skill command Facilitates a complete feedback loop: build → deploy → inspect → fix → rebuild maui-ai-debugging is a skill that provides AI-powered debugging capabilities for .NET MAUI applications, facilitating a seamless development experience.');
